PROJECT HISTORY

AgentVille continues the work previously published as "Claude & Antigravity
Agent Monitor" at github.com/leandrosilvaferreira/claude-agents-view-vscode,
authored by the same copyright holder under a prior account. The project was
renamed and re-released from a fresh repository at version 0.1.0.

